    "landing_accordion_66nWAm": {
      "type": "landing-accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "item_cbxQGk": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "star",
            "title": "What’s inside?",
            "content": "<p>A dad–kid mission system built around a tear-out mission book, with trophy stickers, an achievement poster and bragging rights to earn.</p><p>Inside, you’ll find funny, practical missions with a script for each. Complete them, collect stickers, fill the achievement poster and work your way towards the ultimate title: <strong>Best Dad in the World</strong>.</p><p>No perfect parenting required. Just questionable decisions and stories worth retelling.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_qy9BV8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "package",
            "title": "Size & what’s included",
            "content": "<p><strong>Book dimensions</strong></p><p>6.3 × 9 × 0.6 in (16 × 22.8 × 1.5 cm)<br/><br/>Weight: 1.0 lb (460 g)</p><p><strong>Included in the package</strong></p><p>The tear-out mission book<br/><br/>One Dad Achievement Poster<br/><br/>One themed sticker pack<br/><br/>One custom sticker envelope</p><p>Everything needed to start completing missions and earning your first sticker tonight.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_tByHaG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "truck",
            "title": "Shipping & returns",
            "content": "<p><strong>Ships the next business day</strong> from Ljubljana, Slovenia, with tracking all the way to your door. Delivery usually takes <strong>3–5 business days</strong>. In rare cases (customs or carrier delays) it can take up to 2 weeks.</p><p><strong>30 days to change your mind.</strong> Not feeling it? Tell us within 30 days of delivery and send the kit back unopened. Sale purchases included. No restocking fee, no lecture.</p><p><strong>How a return works:</strong></p><p>1. Email <strong>info@bestdadbook.com</strong> with your order number.<br/>2. Send the kit back unopened, in its original plastic wrapping, within 14 days of your email.<br/>3. We refund the price you paid to your original payment method within 14 days of receiving it.</p><p><strong>Arrived damaged or wrong?</strong> That one’s on us. Email us (a photo helps) and we’ll put it right, return costs included.</p><p>Change-of-mind returns go back to us in Slovenia, and the return postage is on you. All the details are in our <a href=\"https://bestdadbook.com/policies/refund-policy\">Return Policy</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "item_cbxQGk",
        "item_qy9BV8",
        "item_tByHaG"
      ],
