        "kicker": "",
        "heading": "Saturday, 10 a.m. Total silence.",
        "body": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Then you find them. Under the dining table. Two kids, one dad, one plan.</span></p><p>They’re drawing on the underside of the table. It’s called Vandalism Deluxe. It’s mission 20. <strong>It’s in the book.</strong></p><p>He didn’t improvise it. It came with instructions.</p><p>You bought him a gift. Now he’s the favorite parent. Congratulations, it’s a good problem to have. <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">You get to finish a hot coffee. Probably.</span></p>",
