            "text": "<p>When the kids ask “<em>What are we doing today?</em>”, he doesn’t have to scramble for an idea. He picks a mission, checks the instructions and goes.</p><p><strong>Together they build, search, cook, make a mess or rescue something.</strong> Sometimes successfully.</p>",
