        },
        "benefit_CfEx84": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "callout": "A poster that reminds them every day: “Me and Dad did that.”",
            "text": "<p>On the wall next to the bed, the poster becomes a map of their missions together. <strong>Every sticker is proof of a mission pulled off,</strong> and the next one is waiting.</p>",
